what: okay-compose/ — a Gradle/Kotlin project outside sbt, with NO okay
  dependency: a pure protocol module (the shapes, the JSON codec with
  the {"Case":{...}} sum, tree patching, the hybrid rule) whose test
  replays docs/protocol/conformance.jsonl; and a Compose Multiplatform
